    <string name="agent_limits_note">Notes: a UI element must be exposed to Accessibility to be found or tapped by selector (coordinate tap/swipe always works). Screenshots and OCR need Android 11+. "Stop app" only kills background processes - Android does not allow a normal app to force-stop a foreground app or clear another app\'s data without root, the way a host-side \"adb shell am force-stop\" can. Installing an APK still needs one user confirmation tap. Use the agent only on networks you trust - anyone with the token can control the device.</string>
